{"id":"ertona-crystal","name":{"en":"Ertona Crystal","ja":"エルトナ水晶","tc":"艾爾托納水晶","sc":"艾尔托纳水晶"},"desc1":{"en":"Heh heh, you can get this crystal in Ertona. With its faint shining, it's beautiful, isn't it?","ja":"「ふふ、エルトナで採れる水晶だね。　ぼんやり光って、綺麗なんだよねぇ…」","tc":"「呵呵，這是在艾爾托納能採到的水晶呢。　發出淡淡的光芒，好漂亮……」","sc":"“呵呵，这是在艾尔托纳能采到的水晶呢。　发出淡淡的光芒，好漂亮……”"},"desc2":{"en":"Yeah. In dim Ertona, it's even prized as a substitute for a light.","ja":"「ええ。薄暗いエルトナだと、明かりの　代わりとしても重宝されてるわね」","tc":"「對呀，在昏暗的艾爾托納，也常常　拿來當作照明使用。」","sc":"“对呀，在昏暗的艾尔托纳，它们也常常　被拿来当作照明使用。”"},"char1":"firis","char2":"liane","level":19,"trait":{"id":"light-of-harmony","name":{"en":"Light of Harmony","ja":"調和の光","tc":"調和之光","sc":"调和之光"}},"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石）","tc":"（礦石）","sc":"（矿石）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-ore","add":false},{"id":"gem","name":{"en":"(Gem)","ja":"（宝石）","tc":"（寶石）","sc":"（宝石）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-jewels","add":false},{"id":"hidden-power","name":{"en":"(Hidden Power)","ja":"（神秘の力）","tc":"（神祕之力）","sc":"（神秘之力）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-magic-tools","add":false}],"locations":[{"id":"parched-plains","name":{"en":"Parched Plains","ja":"乾いた平野帯","tc":"乾枯平原帶","sc":"干枯平原带"}},{"id":"silent-labyrinth","name":{"en":"Silent Labyrinth","ja":"深閑のラビュリント","tc":"靜寂的迷宮","sc":"静寂的迷宫"}},{"id":"ertona","name":{"en":"Ertona","ja":"エルトナ","tc":"艾爾托納","sc":"艾尔托纳"}},{"id":"wavebreaker-cove","name":{"en":"Wavebreaker Cove","ja":"波座の伏籠","tc":"止浪的伏籠","sc":"止浪的伏笼"}}],"monsters":[{"id":"heavenly-bird","name":{"en":"Heavenly Bird","ja":"月天の霊鳥","tc":"月天靈鳥","sc":"月天灵鸟"}},{"id":"tempestus","name":{"en":"Tempestus","ja":"テンペスタス","tc":"颶風狂魔","sc":"飓风狂魔"}},{"id":"atria","name":{"en":"Atria","ja":"アトリア","tc":"三角形三","sc":"三角形三"}},{"id":"becrux","name":{"en":"Becrux","ja":"ベクルックス","tc":"十字架三","sc":"十字架三"}}],"fixed_components":[{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Shining","ja":"光っている","tc":"散發光芒","sc":"散发光芒"},"value":10}],"random_components":[{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Strong Shine","ja":"強い光輝","tc":"強烈光輝","sc":"强烈光辉"}